    "source": "What the item is beyond its SRD or pack row; all of it for invented loot, [] when none fits. The server reads these for potions, scrolls, rations and water, light, foci, ammunition, silvered or adamantine weapons, and treasure. For an SRD or pack item, only what it adds to its row: a silvered longsword is srdName 'Longsword' with tags ['silvered']; omit them otherwise. Omit while it is unidentified.",
